2 CONC EVNA VSEVOLZHSKAYA (1856 - 3.1.1913), and daughter NATALIA - for the book. NIKOLAI IVANOVICH SHAKHOVSKY (1823-90). Brother PETER IWANOWITCH TROUBETZKOY. 
