1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Elizabrth Francis was born 1807 in Virginia, and died AFT 1860 in Floyd County, Kentucky. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family
2 CONT
2 CONT https://wc.rootsweb.com/trees/158896/I318/elizabrth-francis/individual
2 CONT
2 CONT She married John M. Elliott on 27 JAN 1827 in Floyd County, Kentucky, son of Michael /Elliott/ and Mary /Trim/. He was born BET 1781 AND 1790 in Scott County, Obeys Creek, Virginia, and died 13 JAN 1850 in Big Mud Creek, Floyd Cou
2 CONC nty, Kentucky. He was buried in Joe Reynolds/Elliott Cemetery, Big Mud, Floyd County, Kentucky. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Elizabrth /Francis/ and John M. /Elliott/ are:
2 CONT * Pheny Elliott was born ABT 1831 in Floyd County, Kentucky, and died 1870.
2 CONT * Matilda Jane Elliott was born NOV 1831 in Big Mud Creek, Floyd County, Kentucky, and died UNKNOWN in Rowan County, Kentucky.
2 CONT * Robert Shankland Elliott was born 9 JUL 1832 in Big Mud Creek, Floyd County, Kentucky, and died 6 NOV 1916
2 CONT
