2 CONT After his early death, his daughter Liuba Alexandrovna Narishkina (later Princess Obolenskaya when she married) and his son Vadim Alexandrovich Narishkin were adopted by his sister and brother-in-law Princess Maria Dimitrievna Gal
2 CONC itzine and Prince Fedor (Theodore) Sergueiyevich Galitizine. They kept their Narishkin name by Imperial Ukaze but received a modified coat of arms wherein the Narishkin eagle was replaced with one of the two Galitzine bears.
