1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Death Notice and Will Documents of Prince Boris Found and Uploaded.
2 CONT
2 CONT He died at Lady Dudley Nursing Home in Johannesburg, South Africa. Death Notice was Signed by: Hungarian Consulate on 26/01/1911 Please Note:  Age at death shows as 71.  However, he may have been 61 years old.
2 CONT
2 CONT All Property / Estate was willed to his Brother, Sergius who resided in Dresden, Germany at the time. Personal clothing, trinkets, were gifted to Bell George Lloyd of Johannesburg, South Africa.
2 CONT
