1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Stakhovich, Georgi Aleksandrovich (31.X.1884+10.VI.1958).  Educated in the Elets Lyceum and the University of St. Petersburg,  Secretary of the 2nd Department of the Senate,  Collegiate Secretary (1913).  Left Russ
2 CONC ia after the revolution and died in the United States.  His twin brother Aleksandr entered the Preobrazhenski Regiment at the beginning of the War,  but ~although I presently have no record of Georgi's service in the Regiment ~the
2 CONC  reference could only be to the latter.
2 CONT
