1 NOTE Wiley J. Amburgey and Diannah Adams married and settled in Knott
2 CONT County, KY. on
2 CONT Burgey's Creek of the Little Carr.  They had 10 children They were:
2 CONT Rebecca, Margaret (our line), Jane, Elizabeth, Mary "Polly", Ambrous,
2 CONT Susan, John, Jess, Robert Umphry, & William R.  Dianna died in Knott
2 CONT County, Kentucky on 17 Jun 1883.   After her death, Wiley J. married
2 CONT Sirrilda Madden and they had 9 more children.  The house where Wiley
2 CONT J. raised all 19 children is still standing.  It is in good condition
2 CONT and has now been
2 CONT designated as a historical landmark by  Kentucky's Historical
2 CONT Commission and will be
2 CONT preserved for future generations.
